{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2021-06-16 16:30:00', 'title': "BIOGEN ANNOUNCES TOPLINE RESULTS FROM PHASE 2 STUDY OF GOSURANEMAB, AN ANTI-TAU ANTIBODY, FOR ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE", 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS., JUNE 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED TOPLINE RESULTS FROM ITS PHASE 2 TANGO STUDY OF GOSURANEMAB (BIIB092), AN INVESTIGATIONAL ANTI-TAU ANTIBODY THAT WAS BEING EVALUATED AS A POTENTIAL TREATMENT FOR ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE."}